      "text": "linear in sequence length",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1040
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "---",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1044
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "than standard attention, thanks to the massively reduced amount of HBM access. We analyze the IO complexity",
