      "text": "fig:micros",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1173
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "). Moreover, we provide a lower bound, showing that no exact attention algorithm can asymptotically improve on the number of HBM accesses over all SRAM sizes. We also show that ",
      "n_tokens_est": 34,
      "pos_start_est": 1176
    },
    {
